        </div>
        
        <div class="footer-contact">
            <span>Kết nối với chúng tôi:</span>
            <a href="https://zalo.me/0336672088" target="_blank" class="contact-btn zalo">
                <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/91/Icon_of_Zalo.svg/1200px-Icon_of_Zalo.svg.png" width="16"> Zalo
            </a>
            <a href="https://discord.gg/edkSbVmP4D" target="_blank" class="contact-btn discord">
                <img src="https://assets-global.website-files.com/6257adef93867e56f84d3092/636e0a6a49cf127bf92de1e2_icon_clyde_blurple_RGB.png" width="16"> Discord
